            "end_line": 46,
            "line_count": 4,
            "preview": "// A char prefix is stored as a CharMatcher; the suffix is left untouched. sub.setVariablePrefix('<'); assertPrefixImpl(\"CharMatcher\", sub);"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 48,
            "end_line": 51,
            "line_count": 4,
            "preview": "// A String prefix switches the backing matcher back to a StringMatcher. sub.setVariablePrefix(\"<<\"); assertPrefixImpl(\"StringMatcher\", sub);"
          },
          {
            "start_line": 53,
            "end_line": 56,
            "line_count": 4,
            "preview": "// A null String prefix is rejected and leaves the existing matcher in place. assertThrows(IllegalArgumentException.class, () -> sub.setVariablePrefix((String) null)); assertPrefixImpl(\"StringMatcher\", sub);"
